Namina diabadikeun janten &lt;a href="UIN%20Maulana%20Malik%20Ibrahim"&gt;UIN Maulana Malik Ibrahim&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Malang"&gt;Malang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jawa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Jawa Wétan&lt;/a&gt;.
