 di &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; séjén, kayaning &lt;a href="Tiongkok"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;, sarta sakuliah &lt;a href="Asia%20Tenggara"&gt;Asia Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;.
